<title>USA: United Int'l names Schneider president.</title>
<headline>United Int'l names Schneider president.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER, Colo. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>United International Holdings Inc said its chairman and chief executive officer Gene Schneider has been given the additional title of president.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to comment on who previously held the title of president.</p>
<p>United Internatioanl provides multi-channel television service outside the United States.</p>
<p>(( New York newsdesk 212-859-1610 ))</p>
</text>
